==Strategy==
Because the stage mostly consists of Alien enemies, it is highly recommended to use units that are most effective against them. Units like [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]] can help a lot in this stage.

For the beginning, you're gonna want to upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] before the main enemies spawn and then save up for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. After the first enemies start appearing, use meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] to stall the enemies. When you summon in your Bahamut, start placing down your other units. You should be able to defeat the oncoming horde of Helmut Krabbes and Imperator Saels, achieving victory. For Chapter 3 you can use [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] for better results, but she can be replaced with an Uber.

